{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bare Knuckle Sandwich is a 2D boxing game featuring side-scrolling storytelling and a character driven narrative. Follow Gunner as he joins an underground bare-knuckle boxing ring looking for something to strive for in a world full of con-artists, grifters, and people just trying to get by. After meeting a new mentor, Gunner begins to find his footing after a rough start to adulthood. However, it's a long way to the top and he'll have to overcome everyone standing in his way to succeed, especially himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486370/extras/2D_BARE-KNUCKLE_BOXING.png?t=1744292965\" />Enter the ring and fight unique opponents, each with their own fight style and tricks up their sleeves. Fight your way up the ladder of victory and make a name for yourself amongst the best fighters the city has to offer. Master quick reactions, precise dodging, and devastating strikes to send your opponents reeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486370/extras/guru.gif?t=1744292965\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486370/extras/SIDE-SCROLLING_STORYTELLING.png?t=1744292965\" />Experience Gunner\u2019s personal journey of early adulthood through hand-crafted dialogue and cutscenes. Between fights, explore the city and mingle with the locals. Meet a variety of interesting people and help Gunner make a friend or two. His rise to the top will also attract brutal enemies.  <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486370/extras/DOG.gif?t=1744292965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486370/extras/MINI_GAMES.png?t=1744292965\" />Training to be the best bare-knuckle boxer around takes a lot of time, but it doesn't pay the bills. Perform a variety of side hustles to earn some extra cash. Make sure to save some money to buy info on your next fight.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486370/extras/SOUNDTRACK.png?t=1744292965\" />Bare Knuckle Sandwich features music by the artist Torture World setting the atmosphere during exploration, fights, and cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486370/extras/club.gif?t=1744292965\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Back to Bean Bags","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486370/6cf26ffc4a47ec17283d207814999d70647681c3.jpg"},{"name":"One Hit Wonder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486370/3fb42fb961eb9e5f31f5cb2dd04175e1e2a2ddb5.jpg"},{"name":"Folie \u00e0 Deux","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486370/8f6539ab8bfd4c929d1436d5ea0e329fde7a037e.jpg"},{"name":"The Bigger They Are","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486370/68010121524a6aa8445d81cfd373bd267f7b4fc2.jpg"},{"name":"Need More Concealer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486370/1349cd59b416c7f744206e5236bce993d7421f2c.jpg"},{"name":"Like One of My Japanese Animes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486370/995a349acd79b5a93d4d198000fff5c0885abae7.jpg"},{"name":"Black and Blue-Pilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486370/633d4ed94cba068790f805240a9651361bf93a64.jpg"},{"name":"Run on the Bank","path":"https://cdn.ak